{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's only Room For One!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most popular (<i>and only</i>) hotel in town is quickly filling up and you need a place to stay <strong>bad.</strong> By the time you get there, the front desk is still packed with potential patrons but <i>only one available room left</i>. Looks like you're out of luck...or are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room For One! is an online multiplayer game where up to 6 players compete in a cut-throat race within deadly environments. Choose from up to 3 classes each with their own ability to get an edge in the race, and use items found along the way to help you and hinder others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for 2-6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive races within a unique locale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 classes with special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items to help yourself or sabotage others</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693260?t=1749681948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693260?t=1749681948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693260/c7e10e2c7e3f5137dad9f28bdfc34dfa466b1cc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749681948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693260/c7e10e2c7e3f5137dad9f28bdfc34dfa466b1cc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749681948","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's only Room For One!</strong></h2><p cl